Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:07.48,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch currently has around \Nseven hundred thousand subscribers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.77,0:00:09.21,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Seven hundred thousand...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:11.89,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,There's one month and ten days \Nleft until the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:15.99,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,It should prove quite difficult for them \Nto reach a million subscribers in that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:17.85,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:22.62,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I shall continue to keep \Nan eye on their channel.
