Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.33,0:00:54.55,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hello? Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.93,0:00:59.09,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Okay, looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.09,0:01:01.96,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sorry for barely making it in time!
