Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:13.96,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\shad2\bord2\fnImpact\pos(235,121.5)\c&HEB01E1&\3c&HCC103B&\4c&HEFC8C9&}Draculmania
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:09.87,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Today, I'll be playing the 1988 Komachi title
