Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:16.47,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(280,14.5)\c&HC2AFB8&}takomaru {\c&H91848B&}Never heard of it. But it sounds like fun.\N{\c&HC2AFB8&}KKK {\c&H91848B&}Is it a horror game?\N{\c&HC2AFB8&}The Manager {\c&H91848B&}Awesome, an endurance stream\N{\c&HC2AFB8&}anny {\c&H91848B&}We're in for a long night!\N{\c&HC2AFB8&}Snail {\c&H91848B&}The memories!!!!!\N{\c&HC2AFB8&}Tanaka_3 {\c&H91848B&}I've heard the name but never played it\N{\c&HC2AFB8&}calcium deficient {\c&H91848B&}i played draculmania so much\Nas a kid, but all i remember is how hard it was...\N{\c&HC2AFB8&}Fairy Child {\c&H91848B&}Thanks for the late night stream!\N{\c&HC2AFB8&}grass ball {\c&H91848B&}I'll be working with Yukizuri in the\Nbackground! All-nighter time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:17.83,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,as an endurance stream until \NI beat... the game...
