Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:03.78,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(152,1)\fs32\fnArial Black\c&H973EEC&\pos(320,164)}Stay Tuned for Updates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:10.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Raise your hand if you know \Nwhy we're having this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:11.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yes, Live?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.45,0:03:15.42,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The mysterious new MayoPan video that \Ngot uploaded without our knowledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:16.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:18.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I privated it as soon as I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.70,0:03:22.64,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but a number of diehard fans saw, \Nand Sakura asked me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:27.50,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Now, of all times, uploading a cheap-looking \Nvideo with only hiragana and no kanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:29.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:31.27,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hey, Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's totally you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:33.49,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's 100% {\i1}you{\i0}, Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.49,0:03:35.62,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Y-You're barking up the wrong tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:38.67,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Oh, you can't whistle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:40.15,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Let me show you how—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.15,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ichiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.45,0:03:42.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:44.27,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.27,0:03:49.41,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I thought we'd get a huge boost in subs \Nif we brought on a new member!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:52.28,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san, we're at fault here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.28,0:03:54.46,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,We knew how much pressure \NIchiko-chan was under.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:57.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko, the rest of us are \Nfeeling the same pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:00.82,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're trying all sorts of ideas and \Ndoing our best to shoot videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:02.47,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It's not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:05.22,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,We need something big, with {\i1}lots{\i0} of impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:09.73,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,And since I knew Masaki used to be \Na famous NewTuber...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.73,0:04:10.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:13.01,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You wanted to bring Masaki on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:13.86,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:16.04,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,What do you mean, famous?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.86,0:04:20.23,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\shad2\c&H434147&\3c&HEFEDEE&\4c&HC35FF5&}Trending NewTuber Gossip\N{\c&H585B58&\3c&HEAEFEB&\shad0\fs16}Gossip Roundup of Hyped-Up Sisters Ex-Member Masakichi:\NReal Name, Age, Public Controversy{article title}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:19.29,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,They wrote up a gossip article.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:20.23,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,They sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:23.13,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,She's getting hate comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:24.11,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H33&\an7\bord0\blur0.2\p1\c&HFBFEFB&\pos(301,14.5)\fscx325\fscy196}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.49,0:04:24.11,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\an7\bord3\c&H3F423F&\3c&HFBFEFB&\pos(314.5,25)}- {\c&HA25FEB&}Public Outcry {\c&H3F423F&}After Actions on Stream\N\NThe public response to Masakichi-san's\Nacts of violence\N\NHere is a sample of how people felt\Nafter this series of scandalous events.\N\Nachan {\c&HBEC1BE&}@achanchan8420\N{\c&HA2A9A5&\fs14}I don't know much about Masakichi from Hype-Sis,\Nbut there's no excuse for punching your colleague\Non stream in front of a large audience.\NNot to mention right in the face lol
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:24.11,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,She sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.11,0:04:26.78,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you I {\i1}don't{\i0} appear on camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:31.26,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But Live-sama said, "Masaki absolutely \Nwants to be in our videos!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:31.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:34.50,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,If bringing you on can increase \Nour sub count even a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:36.75,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'd rather stick to coming up with video ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.75,0:04:39.38,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You can do that {\i1}and{\i0} star in our videos!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:42.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Y-You've all been together for a long time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:45.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Adding me into the mix would ruin the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:47.42,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,There never was a balance to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.01,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I mean, still...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:50.14,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.81,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,"LOL at socking her out \Nafter acting all chummy on camera."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:55.88,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,"Booting Masakichi was the right move."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:58.86,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,"Why does anyone like \Nwatching her? She's so nasty."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:04:59.82,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't read them out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:05.15,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I get comments like these all the time \Nfrom so-called Outside Kids fans!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.15,0:05:09.39,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Like, "Seriously though, \Nwhat kind of name is Tokage? LMAO."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:13.01,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Or, "Back in high school, \NTokage-san stole money from me."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.01,0:05:14.91,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Or, "Shut up, you're ugly as hell."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.91,0:05:17.79,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,We're fellow hater targets!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:20.42,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,This is the latest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:26.68,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\an7\c&H7E6A71&\3c&HFCFFFC&\bord3\pos(334,16)}Mio @ Outside Girl  {\c&HBCAFB5&}1 week ago\N{\c&H7B7A78&}I can't stand Tokage. To think she got to\Nbreathe the same air as the Outside Kids.\NDrop dead
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:22.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"I can't stand Tokage."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:26.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"To think she breathed \Nthe same air as the Outside Kids."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:27.60,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"Drop dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:29.93,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,These guys are nothing more than pesky ants!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:34.26,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'm a woolly mammoth, \Nso I'll crush them all I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:35.81,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Stomp! Stomp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:37.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Anyway, I don't do on-camera—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:45.86,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.25,0:05:47.10,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:50.49,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You have something to say to me, do you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:54.12,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I came all this way, so out with it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:57.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:05:58.29,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:06:00.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's too early for our blood supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:01.54,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:04.76,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Does she mean the video?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:07.13,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, the new member thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.13,0:06:08.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:13.60,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Um, is this about us adding a member?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.89,0:06:15.85,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:22.30,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Uh, we weren't going to add a human \Nwho doesn't know about us or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:25.96,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,So you wanted a member \Nwho knew all about your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:31.12,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Announcing a new member \Nwithout their consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:33.16,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,How so very inconsiderate of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:34.76,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:38.66,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's got nothing to do with you, \Ndoes it, Shigeyuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:44.13,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to call me Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.85,0:06:48.51,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Besides, I believe it's got \N{\i1}plenty{\i0} to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.51,0:06:52.01,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs30\fnArial Black\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&\bord1\move(12,20,-300,20)}Ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC2D163&\3c&HDBEC9E&}ho
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:52.01,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:54.80,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I released that video without asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:55.39,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:58.69,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I wanted to do something \Nto get more subscribers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.13,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:04.02,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,So you're hoping to invite someone\N with a degree of popularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:05.77,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.45,0:07:10.53,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,So you found out about my secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:11.28,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fnComic Sans MS\bord2.5\c&H67F9F8&\3c&H6C38E6&}Eh....?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:11.28,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:18.54,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Namely, that I am Yukirinko, \Nthe mega-famous gaming streamer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:19.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:21.64,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Gaming streamer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:26.42,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,It seems as though you wanted to \Nstrong-arm me into joining your channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:28.65,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,However, quite frankly, I must refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:30.80,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's true that I'd be a perfect fit,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:34.26,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,but joining you as a new member...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.26,0:07:34.93,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:39.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.09,0:07:40.06,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I th-think...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:40.65,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:40.96,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:41.60,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:42.34,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Whisper, whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:42.76,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:44.92,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Whisper, whisper, whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:47.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Yeah, okay, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:49.49,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Shigeyuki-san, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:50.49,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:52.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You really don't need to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:55.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We had zero intention of inviting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:07:57.49,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:07:58.98,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It wasn't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:00.75,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.24,0:08:01.88,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:04.71,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:10.21,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,S-S-So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:11.47,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:13.47,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Playing hard to get?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:14.56,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:17.48,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's not like you to be so modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:18.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:20.85,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The new member was going to be Masaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.78,0:08:25.08,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I can't believe you thought \Nwe were trying to invite {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.61,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:29.39,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:31.53,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,If you're going to be so stubborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:35.45,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'm willing to wait until you \Nwork up the courage to invite me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:42.41,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,N-N-N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.41,0:08:45.21,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I really thought their new member was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:49.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:51.88,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Can you not barge in like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:55.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is {\i1}my{\i0} bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:57.64,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H707576&\frz4.215\pos(402,146.5)}Yukizuri Gaming Channel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:57.64,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\fs16\frz4.215\3c&HE375E1&\pos(442.5,267.5)}7244 subscribers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:08:57.31,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.50,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Yukirinko? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:02.64,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,7,244 subscribers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:05.14,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,All she plays is ancient games!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:07.87,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Does Yuki-sama like playing games?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:08.52,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:11.53,Default,Live,0,0,0,,She once got so addicted,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:14.03,Default,Live,0,0,0,,she was incapable of doing anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:20.72,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Which made Mother furious, and all \Nher games got destroyed... I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:25.91,Default,Live,0,0,0,,When she gets into something, \Nshe always ends up with tunnel vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:27.92,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\bord2\c&H7FF1F2&\3c&H253AD7&\pos(350,189.333)}MayoPan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:31.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Can you leave after you finish that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:34.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:38.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well, that {\i1}was{\i0} an \Nembarrassing misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:40.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Real cringe-worthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:42.22,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Gloom...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.51,0:09:44.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,H-Hey, cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:48.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Here, why don't you drink some of my blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:49.94,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.29,0:09:55.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What? I thought my blood was tasty, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:57.74,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,If you ask me, it's nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:09:58.94,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't be so conceited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.94,0:10:01.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:04.45,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Man, seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:06.36,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's so embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:09.46,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,In the past, I really liked video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:11.00,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,She's starting a whole story now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.33,0:10:15.22,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,So after I began monitoring your channel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:19.13,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,when I came across a game streaming channel, \NI wanted to give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:22.89,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,At first, I was satisfied with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:26.64,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,But after seeing all of them \Nhave fun at that festival...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:31.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You wanted to become \Na part of it yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.85,0:10:35.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Streaming video games, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:38.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I {\i1}did{\i0} consider trying it out for MayoPan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:42.32,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,In that case!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.32,0:10:45.08,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Let me show you how fun games can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:46.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:47.24,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.24,0:10:50.91,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's a hard no on having Shige \Ncome on as a member, agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:51.69,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:54.19,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Yuki-sama can be a little scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:56.62,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'm not giving up my slice of the profits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.62,0:10:57.65,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.65,0:11:00.22,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The courage to say no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:03.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You know, if you want to join MayoPan...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.97,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:07.15,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why not just be honest and ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:08.54,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I see no reason to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:13.10,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,and even if I {\i1}were{\i0} to ask, \NI could never demean myself before Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:14.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:15.12,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:16.75,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,O-Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:19.12,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's the deal with you and Live?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:19.99,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,The deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:22.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You two are always fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:25.74,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:33.50,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fs38\fnCourier New\an7\c&H10190D&\t(6993,7744,\c&H030805&)\pos(117,112.5))}Continue        story\N\N\N\NStart           story\N\N\NLeave           room
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:28.94,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,would be a very, very long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:41.74,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Mother's blood runs strongest in Live and me,\Nmaking us both elite vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:47.94,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,On Mother's orders, we purged \Nthe vampires who wished harm upon humans
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:50.39,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,and created an orderly world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:55.15,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Back then, we were both rivals and comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:58.68,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Thanks to our actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.15,0:12:03.82,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fnCourier New\an7\fs14\move(117.5,114.5,117.5,-32.5)\shad1\c&HEAE5D9&\4c&H491223&\clip(103.5,60,382.5,158.5)}It became possible for humans\Nand vampires to coexist in peace.\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NAnd yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:12:01.94,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,it became possible for humans \Nand vampires to coexist in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:03.52,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:07.58,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\fnCourier New\an7\fs13\shad1\c&HEAE5D9&\4c&H491223&\pos(216,296)\clip(213,272,245,340.5)\t(21,522,\clip(213,272,485,340.5))}Mother\N\N\N"Take this as a reward."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:09.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\fnCourier New\an7\fs13\shad1\c&HEAE5D9&\4c&H491223&\pos(216,296)\clip(213,272,245,340.5)\t(21,522,\clip(213,272,485,340.5))}Yuki\N\N\N"Thank you very much."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.37,0:12:12.08,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\fnCourier New\an7\fs13\shad1\c&HEAE5D9&\4c&H491223&\pos(216,296)\clip(213,272,245,340.5)\t(21,522,\clip(213,272,485,340.5))}Live\N\N\N"I want the one with a pendant!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.62,0:12:13.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\fnCourier New\an7\fs13\shad1\c&HEAE5D9&\4c&H491223&\pos(216,296)\clip(213,272,245,340.5)\t(21,522,\clip(213,272,485,340.5))}Live\N\N\N"Yoink!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:14.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\fnCourier New\an7\fs13\shad1\c&HEAE5D9&\4c&H491223&\pos(216,296)\clip(213,272,245,340.5)\t(21,522,\clip(213,272,485,340.5))}Yuki\N\N\N"What?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:17.34,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\fnCourier New\an7\fs13\shad1\c&HEAE5D9&\4c&H491223&\pos(216,296)\clip(213,272,245,340.5)\t(21,522,\clip(213,272,485,340.5))}Yuki\N\N\N"Wait, Live!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:18.82,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,Live betrayed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:19.34,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fnCourier New\an7\fs40\shad4\c&HD4CDC3&\4c&H3F0F0A&\move(411,159.5,100.5,159.5,21,1981)}Yuki\N\N\N\N"How could you?! Live!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.74,0:12:23.08,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,After that, every time we met...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:25.59,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnCourier New\an7\fs14\pos(135,304.5)\c&HE7F6EA&\4c&H27242D&\shad1\clip(128.5,281,170.5,326.5)\t(23,357,\clip(128.5,281,500.5,326.5))}Live "Shigeyuki, did you say something just now?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:25.84,DefaultItalicsTop,Live,0,0,0,,Shigeyuki, did you say something just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:27.10,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnCourier New\an7\fs14\c&HE7F6EA&\4c&H27242D&\shad1\pos(152,278)}Fine... Shigeyuki it is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:27.10,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnCourier New\an7\fs14\c&HE7F6EA&\4c&H27242D&\shad1\pos(152,301)}I told you not to call me Shigeyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:29.47,DefaultItalicsTop,Live,0,0,0,,Neener, neener! Shigeyuki, Shigeyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:29.47,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnCourier New\an7\fs14\c&HE7F6EA&\4c&H27242D&\shad1\pos(302,291)\clip(297,282.5,317,332)\t(23,315,\clip(297,282.5,520,332))}Live "Neener, neener!\N\N\h\h\h\h\h\hShigeyuki, Shigeyuki!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.15,DefaultItalicsTop,Live,0,0,0,,Need something from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:32.73,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnCourier New\an7\fs14\pos(135,304.5)\c&HE7F6EA&\4c&H27242D&\shad1\clip(128.5,281,170.5,326.5)\t(23,357,\clip(128.5,281,500.5,326.5))}Live "Need something from me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:37.23,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnCourier New\an7\fs14\c&HE7F6EA&\4c&H27242D&\shad1\pos(153,277)}Nothing, really
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:37.23,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnCourier New\an7\fs14\c&HE7F6EA&\4c&H27242D&\shad1\pos(154,301)}Why don't we walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:42.15,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnCourier New\an9\fs14\c&HE7F6EA&\4c&H27242D&\shad1)\pos(433,302)\clip(129.5,283.5,171,334)\t(28,237,\clip(129.5,283.5,446,334))}Live   "No, thanks. I think I'll go back\Nby myself tonight!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:41.08,DefaultItalicsTop,Live,0,0,0,,No, thanks. I think I'll go back \Nby myself tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:42.15,DefaultHigh,Yuki,0,0,0,,She tore my heart into shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:44.68,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,So I made up my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:47.71,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,to part ways with Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:51.08,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,That's what happened between Live and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:52.91,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,What a flimsy tale!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:57.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So, like... I can't believe you still \Nwant to join a channel with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:13:00.90,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,After enough time, you manage \Nto tolerate a good deal of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.34,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Besides, she...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:08.10,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Live is fickle, irresponsible, \Nand a real handful,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:11.55,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,but unlike me, who puts rules above all else,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.55,0:13:13.85,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,she's honest about the things she likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:18.16,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,That's the one part of her \NI thought I could learn from.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:20.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Can't you use the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:29.00,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Being honest about what you like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:32.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.85,0:13:36.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We'll send over the final footage \Nfor review before uploading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.94,Default,Food Truck Owner,0,0,0,,Sure, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:40.38,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:43.97,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,We sent you a message yesterday. \NWe're the Hyped-Up Sisters...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:49.14,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Wow, check out all that cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.73,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,It looks so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:52.32,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Let's eat, let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.32,0:13:53.51,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:56.32,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're going for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:13:58.76,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Kicchomu, stop the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:13:59.95,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Huh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.95,0:14:02.54,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,I cracked my lips when I went in for the bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:03.40,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:04.69,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:06.49,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you to moisturize them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:07.70,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,I don't have any lip balm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:09.15,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:13.81,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.81,0:14:16.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:20.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're filming with your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.43,0:14:22.71,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Nowadays, we edit on our phones, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:24.24,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:28.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We're doing an eating challenge \Nwith these burgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:30.72,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,You're back to NewTubing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.42,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's right. Behind the scenes, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:35.01,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0}, behind the scenes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:37.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It came as a shock, even for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:38.68,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Tell us your channel name!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:39.60,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,What's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:42.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um... Mayonaka Punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.40,0:14:43.92,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Wait, seriously?! MayoPan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:44.86,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:46.86,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Masaki, you're part of MayoPan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:50.61,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I mean, I {\i1}was{\i0} the one who started the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.61,0:14:51.55,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:53.48,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Tell us more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:55.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.71,0:14:58.37,Default,Youber Eats Driver,0,0,0,,Youber Eats delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:15:01.37,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The burgers are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:04.76,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Is it time already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:07.13,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Go wake Fu and Tokage so we can record.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.38,0:15:08.83,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Where's Masaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:10.26,Default,Live,0,0,0,,She's still not home yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:12.21,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.21,0:15:12.89,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:21.39,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Today's the day I hear your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:26.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:27.85,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Pun—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:28.32,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hey, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:31.97,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,All of you watching the Mayonaka \NPunch channel, nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:34.16,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Gaming streamer Yukirinko here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:39.66,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Some of you must be surprised \Nto see Yukirinko's very first face reveal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:42.17,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,There's a real good reason for that, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:49.24,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm going to be facing Live in an \Neating contest to decide if I join MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.11,0:15:52.93,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,This was supposed to be \NLive-sama's eating challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:56.10,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Everything's changed. Every last bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:16:00.67,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,If Live wins, I'll be officially \Njoining MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:02.77,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,On the other hand, if I win...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:05.85,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,No matter how much the members \Nof MayoPan beg and plead,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:08.19,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I won't be joining as their new member!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:11.53,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,I really don't get what's going on at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:13.42,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,But it's all fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.42,0:16:14.78,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,I just need to avoid winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:19.12,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,This is one battle that \NI can't afford not to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:21.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You've hired someone to \Nschedule appointments for you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:25.53,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,We sure have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:28.83,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,You can even find people to \Nhelp you think up ideas for videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:29.78,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,It's real handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:31.97,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,We still edit our videos ourselves, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:36.43,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Editing won't be easy to hire for, \Nsince we want to preserve that unique charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:40.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It {\i1}does{\i0} take skills to convey that properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:42.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:44.83,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,MayoPan has way more subscribers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:47.94,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,so it's wild that you \Nhandle it all by yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:51.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hype-Sis is around, what, 300k now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:52.12,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,What if it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:53.72,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,So you've been keeping up on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:54.99,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,N-Not really!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.99,0:16:58.41,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Man, breaking up if you don't hit \Na million subs, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:01.49,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Pretty bold to run with an idea \Nthat could get you in hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.49,0:17:04.02,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Was that supposed to be a dig at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:06.88,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,And will you really break up \Nif you don't make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:11.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well, if we don't reach it, the house \Nwe all live in is going to be torn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:14.25,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,The hell? How's {\i1}that{\i0} work?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:17.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Look, it's a really long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:24.39,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,We were thinking of sending a \Nrequest to collab with MayoPan, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:27.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,A collab? R-Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:29.31,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,MayoPan's really entertaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:32.18,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:38.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,O-Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:40.42,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Hey, quit grinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:41.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:42.46,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,You totally are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:43.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Really, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:45.37,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Stop lying! You are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:47.33,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Really takes you back, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:50.70,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Look over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:51.42,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,You're recording?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:53.01,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, is that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.01,0:17:54.56,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:56.93,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,It's been so long, so what's the harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.55,0:17:59.97,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Masaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:01.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll have to pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:02.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,My face looks awful right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:05.15,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,What? Isn't it a little late for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:06.02,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:07.60,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,You look the same as always!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.60,0:18:09.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Shut up! I do {\i1}not!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:13.07,DefaultTop,Otomi,0,0,0,,Get her, Kicchomu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:14.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Cut it out, you dumb gorilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:15.67,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:21.73,Default,Live,0,0,0,,My hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:23.64,Default,Live,0,0,0,,My hand's cramping up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:31.38,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Eat like you mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:34.09,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I was raised with good manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:41.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Now it's my right hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.23,0:18:43.85,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Let's take a break for some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:47.88,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Th-This is such a colossal waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:50.71,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Everything's changed. Every last bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.34,0:18:54.91,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, if I feel like it, \NI'll let you collab with MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:56.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So work hard for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:57.85,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Whawuzzat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.85,0:19:02.45,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,We may have fewer subscribers, \Nbut we have some real hardcore fans!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:04.93,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Some are a little {\i1}too{\i0} hardcore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:06.20,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.40,0:19:08.68,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Hey, Masaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:12.04,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Can we use the video we shot earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:14.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:18.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Was my face all tensed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.59,0:19:19.80,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.42,0:19:23.26,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:28.54,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.94,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:35.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I, Masakichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:39.22,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hereby swear to be honest about what I like!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:37.36,DefaultTop,Kikka,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:38.81,DefaultTop,Otomi,0,0,0,,Not so loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:40.74,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,With that, I bid you farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:45.07,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.07,0:19:46.16,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:53.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:19:59.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I was on camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:03.16,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live! I'll star in our videos!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:06.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:09.13,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I-I did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:11.14,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.14,0:20:14.92,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,And so, the winner of \Nthe eating contest is Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:17.50,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,As much as it pains me to say it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:20.40,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'll be joining MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.61,0:20:23.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:26.41,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Isn't that nice, Ichiko-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.41,0:20:28.24,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san said she'll join.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:30.66,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Everything went exactly as planned!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:34.53,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Come, let us record the video where I join.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:36.61,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You've got nerves of steel, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:37.73,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Shige, out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:38.17,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:42.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I told you to show up on camera \Nwhen I say, "These are our new members!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:44.66,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Call me Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:47.08,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Wait, no, Yukirinko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:50.88,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Just remember, the real highlight here \Nis Masaki joining MayoPan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:54.67,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't get \Nin the way, Yukirinko-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:56.50,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:58.77,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,The main attraction here is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.27,0:21:02.53,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs30\fnArial Black\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&\bord1\move(580,20,-10,20)}Ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho{\c&HC24C89&\3c&HFAC1E1&}ho{\c&H5B4CB7&\3c&HBAB6EC&}ho
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.48,0:21:02.53,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:05.62,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.62,0:21:09.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, I just got a little overexcited.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.19,0:21:13.28,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We finally get to be on video together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.28,0:21:15.13,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm so thrilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:22.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's time for the big climax on our \Nroad to reach one million subscribers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.26,0:21:25.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let's kick it up one last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:28.34,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hey, c'mon, Shige!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.67,0:21:32.05,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You're one of us now, \Nso try and join in for times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.05,0:21:33.04,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,The comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:33.81,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:34.85,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,The comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:37.10,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,They're utter chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:38.10,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:39.52,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.52,0:21:41.77,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFBFEFB&\c&H797C79&\pos(332.5,23)}Ruka  {\c&HBFC0BD&}1 day ago\N{\c&H6B6E6B&}Is Masakichi really involved with them?\N\N{\c&HDD9795&}5 replies\N\N{\c&H656866&}Delhi Amano  {\c&HBFC0BD&}1 day ago\N{\c&H6B6E6B&}Masakichi? Who's that?
